# A Candlelight Vigil (jeuno 6): Ilumida (the first of the two of that name: 17776667; 17776670 is cutscene_only) and
# Rouliette in Upper Jeuno. Ilumida has no script (default 189); Searching for the Right Words also names her. Jeuno
# fame level 4 exactly ((150 + 150 + 150) / 2 = 225): a cube to Ilumida while available (no trade handler: nothing),
# 192 (option 0: Option 1), 193 (option 0: nothing; option 1: begun, Option 0), a cube while accepted (nothing), 191
# without the candle; Candle Making at Rouliette (36, the cube: 37, the Holy Candle); 194 with a full bag (the Flower
# Necklace cannot be given: nothing), 194 (completed: Flower Necklace, Activist for Kindness, fame +13 x3, the candle
# taken, Searching for the Right Words' mustZone set), then completed: Ilumida's default 189 (no section of this quest;
# Searching for the Right Words needs Rubbish Day and Never to Return), a cube (nothing).
lists UpperJeuno/Ilumida/onTrigger UpperJeuno/Ilumida/onTrade UpperJeuno/Rouliette/onTrigger UpperJeuno/Rouliette/onTrade UpperJeuno/onEventFinish/192 UpperJeuno/onEventFinish/193 UpperJeuno/onEventFinish/194 UpperJeuno/onEventFinish/36 UpperJeuno/onEventFinish/37
char zone=UpperJeuno pos=-73.5,-1.2,57.3 job=WAR lvl=30
fame Sandoria 150
fame Bastok 150
fame Windurst 150
item LanolinCube x4
login
walk -74.0,-1.2,57.3
trade Ilumida LanolinCube x1            # available: no trade handler, nothing
trigger Ilumida                         # fame level 4, Option 0: 192
finish option=0                         # not 1: Option 1
trigger Ilumida                         # Option 1: 193
finish option=0                         # not 1: nothing
trigger Ilumida                         # 193
finish option=1                         # begun, Option 0
walk -74.0,-1.2,57.3
trade Ilumida LanolinCube x1            # accepted: no trade handler, nothing
trigger Ilumida                         # accepted, no Holy Candle: 191
finish
trigger Rouliette                       # Candle Making: 36
finish                                  # Candle Making begun
walk -20.2,-1.5,12.6
trade Rouliette LanolinCube x1          # 37
finish                                  # Candle Making completed: the Holy Candle
trigger Ilumida                         # the candle: 194
fill-inventory
finish                                  # no room for the Flower Necklace: not completed
free-inventory
trigger Ilumida                         # 194
finish                                  # completed: Flower Necklace, Activist for Kindness, fame +13 x3, the candle taken, Searching's mustZone
trigger Ilumida                         # completed: no section; Searching not offered (Rubbish Day, Never to Return); default 189
finish
walk -74.0,-1.2,57.3
trade Ilumida LanolinCube x1            # completed: nothing
